-- The RV32 constrained reference profile's core and interrupt slots, which
-- apply when an rv32 program imports no device description (D543, D661).
-- It names no chip and comes from no SVD: the core is the SiFive E31 that
-- QEMU's sifive_e machine carries, taking machine software, timer and
-- external interrupts at mcause codes 3, 7 and 11 through vectored mtvec
-- (D662), so its table has the sixteen standard codes and the description
-- names no interrupt: an external one arrives at 11 through the PLIC.

compiler.device("riscv-reference")
compiler.core("sifive-e31")
compiler.vectors(16)
